 "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "切割页面", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 270], "pos": [1960.695068359375, 298.7556457519531], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 4, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 5, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [2], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [574.3082275390625, 431.5450744628906], "pos": [982.1930541992188, 312.9465637207031], "widgets_values": ["# 核心任务\n基于【上传的参考照片】，生成一个高分辨率的 3×3 照片网格（共 9 张独立照片）。\n\n# 1. 尺寸与分辨率规范 (Technical Specifications)\n- **网格布局**：3行 × 3列 (3x3 Grid)\n- **单图尺寸目标**：1024 × 1024 像素 (Per Panel)\n- **全图总尺寸**：3072 × 3072 像素 (Total Canvas)\n- **画质要求**：原生 3K 分辨率输出，确保每个子网格中的面部细节在 100% 放大时依然清晰锐利，无噪点。\n\n# 2. 绝对一致性约束 (Identity Consistency)\n所有 9 个画面必须【100% 像素级】保留参考图中的以下特征：\n- **人物身份**：完全相同的五官比例、骨相结构。\n- **发型与发色**：锁定发型细节，禁止任何改变。\n- **服装**：锁定服装款式、颜色、材质。\n- **背景**：纯色或极简摄影棚背景，统一色调。\n\n# 3. 表情网格定义 (9种指定情绪)\n请严格按以下顺序在网格中生成对应表情：\n- [1. 左上] **大喜**：开怀大笑，露齿，眼睛笑成弯月。\n- [2. 中上] **愤怒**：眉头紧锁，眼神犀利，怒视。\n- [3. 右上] **悲伤**：眼眶含泪，嘴角下撇，神情委屈。\n- [4. 左中] **惊讶**：瞪大眼睛，张嘴，难以置信。\n- [5. 中中] **疑惑**：挑眉，歪头思考，眼神充满疑问。\n- [6. 右中] **恐惧**：瞳孔收缩，身体后仰，惊慌失措。\n- [7. 左下] **厌恶**：皱鼻，撇嘴，仿佛闻到异味。\n- [8. 中下] **鄙视/无语**：翻白眼 (Rolling eyes) 或面无表情的死鱼眼。\n- [9. 右下] **调皮**：吐舌头，眨眼 (Wink)，做鬼脸。\n\n# 4. 构图规范 (Composition)\n- **景别**：统一为【头部特写 (Headshot)】或【肩部以上 (Shoulder-up)】，保证面部填满 1024px 宽度的 60% 以上。\n- **光照**：柔和影棚光，避免面部出现因网格分割导致的阴影不一致。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 3}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-437.66860005035426, 131.53710177789077], "scale": 0.9646149645000127}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 240, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "我的切割工具地址:https://rabbitlin-web.github.io/smart-crop-tool/", "bounding": [1384.7901611328125, -463.1307373046875, 4168, 309]}], "links": [[1, 2, 0, 1, 0, "IMAGE"], [2, 3, 0, 1, 10, "STRING"], [4, 1, 0, 5, 0, "IMAGE"]], "id": "1b0e0207-c64e-49e9-8196-866c620bd279", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 7, "revision": 0}